  <p>We may update these Beta Terms. If we do, we will ask you to accept the new version at your next sign-in, and we record the version and time you accepted. If you don't accept, your access to the Beta ends.</p>

  <h2>12. General</h2>
  <p>These Beta Terms are governed by the laws of the State of New York, without regard to conflict of law rules. Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@cmokit.ai">hello@cmokit.ai</a>.</p>
